      "description": "<p><span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d8</span> bludgeoning, DC 17 basic Fortitude save</p>\n<details><summary>See rules...</summary>\n<p><p>The monster deals the listed amount of damage to any number of creatures Grabbed or Restrained by it. Each of those creatures can attempt a basic Fortitude save with the listed DC.</p></p></details>",
